 across the full decade, a respectable pace for a business of this size.","Returns on capital run at 28% against a 8% cost of capital \u2014 a 20-point spread that is the clearest signature of an economic moat.","On the balance sheet, leverage is comfortably conservative at 0.2\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, and interest coverage runs at 10.3\u00d7.","Shareholder yield of 4.5% reflects a genuine commitment to returning capital rather than empire-building, and insiders hold 59% of the shares, so management thinks like owners because it is one \u2014 the strongest alignment there is, and within its sector the business captures 5.9\u00d7 its fair share of profits, a structural advantage visible in the numbers."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Altman Z in the grey zone \u2014 financial health warrants monitoring","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Industrials sector lagging the market significantly, underperforming by 6% over 3 months","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Cyclicality and capital intensity \u2014 order books turn on a dime, and the heavy fixed cost base that creates the moat also magnifies the downturn.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Supply chain reshoring costs and labour shortages \u2014 onshoring mandates raise capex requirements while a shrinking skilled-labour pool inflates operating costs.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Tariff and trade-policy exposure \u2014 industrial exporters sit squarely in the crosshairs of protectionist policy, and retaliatory tariffs can close markets without warning.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Operating margins 57% above sector median \u2014 the quantitative trace of pricing power","Trading at a 51% margin of safety to estimated fair value \u2014 a real cushion against errors in the estimate","Valued at a 77% discount to sector median EV/EBITDA",